        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Parallel Arm Bracket for American Eagle 5100</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/commercial-ada-compliant-full-cover-surface-mount-closer-american-eagle-5100\"><b>American Eagle 5100 Door Closers</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-delayed-action-handicap-door-closer-american-eagle-5141-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 5141 Delayed Action Handicap Door Closer</b></a> (for 11 mm closer pinion shaft). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/products/standard-door-closer-arm-for-american-eagle-5100-pdq-519003\"><b>Standard Closer Arm</b></a> Only. For use with closer arm with a 3/8\" diameter pivot ball joint.</b> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-parallel-arm-bracket-for-american-eagle-5100-pdq-999022\"><b>PDQ 999022 Hold Open Arm Parallel Bracket</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nParallel arm mounting brackets are used when the door closer is installed on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.\r\n</p>",
