                "title": "Standard Parallel Arm Bracket for American Eagle 5100, PDQ 999001",
                "description": "PDQ 999001 - Use for Parallel Arm mounting American Eagle 5100 series door closer with standard arm. Parallel arm mounting brackets are use when the door closer is installed on the Push Side of the door. Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.",
